  "lyrics_data": [
    {
      "time_start_ms": 19020,
      "end_ms": 26020,
      "text": "Now and then, I think of when we were together",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 26020,
      "end_ms": 33850,
      "text": "Like when you said you felt so happy you could die",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 33850,
      "end_ms": 37320,
      "text": "Told myself that you were right for me",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 37320,
      "end_ms": 41160,
      "text": "But felt so lonely in your company",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 41160,
      "end_ms": 63100,
      "text": "But that was love, and it's an ache I still remember",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 63100,
      "end_ms": 70890,
      "text": "You can get addicted to a certain kinda sadness",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 70890,
      "end_ms": 78150,
      "text": "Like resignation to the end, always the end",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 78150,
      "end_ms": 82180,
      "text": "So when we found that we could not make sense",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 82180,
      "end_ms": 85790,
      "text": "Well, you said that we would still be friends",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 85790,
      "end_ms": 93450,
      "text": "But I'll admit that I was glad it was over",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 93450,
      "end_ms": 97140,
      "text": "But you didn't have to cut me off",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 97140,
      "end_ms": 101340,
      "text": "Make out like it never happened and that we were nothin'",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 101340,
      "end_ms": 103640,
      "text": "And I don't even need your love",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 103640,
      "end_ms": 108240,
      "text": "But you treat me like a stranger, and that feels so rough",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 108240,
      "end_ms": 111980,
      "text": "No, you didn't have to stoop so low",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 111980,
      "end_ms": 116240,
      "text": "Have your friends collect your records and then change your number",
      "text_tr": "Arkadaşların plaklarını toplasın, sonra da numaranı değiştir",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 116240,
      "end_ms": 118910,
      "text": "Guess that I don't need that, though",
      "text_tr": "Ama sanırım buna ihtiyacım yok",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 118910,
      "end_ms": 126470,
      "text": "Now you're just somebody that I used to know",
      "text_tr": "Artık sadece eskiden tanıdığım birisin",
      "is_target": true
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 126470,
      "end_ms": 133720,
      "text": "Now you're just somebody that I used to know",
      "text_tr": "Artık sadece eskiden tanıdığım birisin",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 133720,
