      "text": "Now you're just somebody that I used to know",
      "text_tr": "Artık sadece eskiden tanıdığım birisin",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 152920,
      "end_ms": 159840,
      "text": "Now and then, I think of all the times you screwed me over",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 159840,
      "end_ms": 168260,
      "text": "But had me believin' it was always somethin' that I'd done",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 168260,
      "end_ms": 171570,
      "text": "But I don't wanna live that way",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 171570,
      "end_ms": 175490,
      "text": "Readin' into every word you say",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 175490,
      "end_ms": 178280,
      "text": "You said that you could let it go",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 178280,
      "end_ms": 182620,
      "text": "And I wouldn't catch you hung up on somebody that you used to know",
      "text_tr": "",
      "is_target": false
    },
    {
      "time_start_ms": 182620,
